      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinita_Park%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Vinita Park was officially incorporated as a village on November 3, 1941, bringing together several northern subdivisions and the Vinita Industrial Park.",
